    <h2>Madagascar (2005)</h2>
    <p><em>Madagascar</em> is a hilarious computer-animated comedy film produced by DreamWorks Animation.</p>
    <p>The plot centers around four pampered animals from the Central Park Zoo—Alex the lion, Marty the zebra, Melman the giraffe, and Gloria the hippo. After an escape attempt goes wrong, they unexpectedly find themselves shipwrecked on the wild island of Madagascar, where they must learn to survive and deal with a colony of lemurs led by the eccentric King Julien.</p>
